{"id": "EUVD-2026-80485", "enisaUuid": "8031b5e8-5aa9-34d7-a193-00941cc3469e", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmedia: platform: mtk-mdp3: Fix SCP device refcounting\n\nmdp_probe() first tries to get the SCP handle with scp_get(). When that\nfails, it falls back to looking up the SCP platform device with\n__get_pdev_by_id() and then reads its driver data.\n\nThe fallback lookup returns the platform device with a reference, just\nlike scp_get() does. However, the fallback path currently drops that\nreference immediately after platform_get_drvdata(). The driver later\nstill calls scp_put(mdp->scp) unconditionally from the probe error path\nand from mdp_video_device_release(), which drops the SCP device\nreference again.\n\nKeep the fallback reference until the existing scp_put() call, so that\nthe fallback path follows the same ownership rules as the scp_get()\npath.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T10:31:49", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:54:18", "baseScore": 8.4, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dce13bd9bade3ecc1acb7579397f24743850997f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/252850653569fdb1a259937e02325cf32c8f0970", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0259ade4c4ceaf1e184a7c1aea8071ad398f9b6f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/55793e4665b7f15151e6f5ab51ca980e73abed5d"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89885", "GHSA-86m7-6x4j-3vh5"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "02214fd9-2f29-3d25-aafb-63b085ae070a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.51"}, {"id": "16849dab-421e-3ce1-a4e4-0f76e288e34f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.19"}, {"id": "24b56fc8-5143-37b1-b247-f6705ffc5c5e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "db4d27e6bbbf511f9cdb33f682535a0a3cb7c403 <dce13bd9bade3ecc1acb7579397f24743850997f"}, {"id": "2c5811e3-812f-3729-9c70-9b2116dad835", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "36b6558b-d6ea-32c4-92b0-f4c9a9a39ef0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.12.64 <6.12.110"}, {"id": "4ead345f-9045-3c53-b0a3-a30ed7c975a2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.18.4 <6.18.51"}, {"id": "52e5fb13-983d-33d9-8197-2df57c19de16", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "31ba1a4d7a5d9466f6ef4910a372b8200f8aad19 <252850653569fdb1a259937e02325cf32c8f0970"}, {"id": "68b0e431-93ce-3e2d-9545-97618914d326", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8f6f3aa21517ef34d50808af0c572e69580dca20 <0259ade4c4ceaf1e184a7c1aea8071ad398f9b6f"}, {"id": "6eddbdeb-1334-303a-961e-487cbeaab4f1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.110"}, {"id": "8141a1b6-3dee-3b87-bd10-eee786e1fe15", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "9ffd2ec1-c0b6-37e7-8ee4-75637278fb8c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.5"}, {"id": "f2fceb1b-2b5b-39e5-8b25-c3ab826a380b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8f6f3aa21517ef34d50808af0c572e69580dca20 <55793e4665b7f15151e6f5ab51ca980e73abed5d"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "713c2f0c-a8ad-3f5e-8780-3762b8f5801e", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}